 php-curl,
 php-cli,
 locales-all,
 libjs-font-awesome,
 libjs-jquery-datatables,
Architecture: all
Section: web
Priority: optional
Description: Administration zone for AbraFlexi
 Web-based administration portal for AbraFlexi operators: sign in with an
 AbraFlexi account and pair customers with the accounts of external services
 (IPEX, Subreg and SledovaniTV are provided by the abraflexi-adminzone-*
 extension packages). Counterpart of abraflexi-clientzone.

Package: abraflexi-adminzone-ipex
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
 debconf (>= 0.5) | debconf-2.0,
 abraflexi-adminzone (= ${binary:Version}),
 php-spojenet-ipex-b2b
Breaks: abraflexi-adminzone (<< 0.4.0)
Replaces: abraflexi-adminzone (<< 0.4.0)
Section: web
Priority: optional
Description: IPEX extension for AbraFlexi AdminZone
 Pairing of IPEX B2B customers with AbraFlexi addresses. Asks for the API credentials on installation.

Package: abraflexi-adminzone-subreg
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
 debconf (>= 0.5) | debconf-2.0,
 abraflexi-adminzone (= ${binary:Version}),
 php-spojenet-subreg
Breaks: abraflexi-adminzone (<< 0.4.0)
Replaces: abraflexi-adminzone (<< 0.4.0)
Section: web
Priority: optional
Description: Subreg extension for AbraFlexi AdminZone
 Pairing of Subreg users with AbraFlexi addresses and creating Subreg contacts from them. Asks for the API credentials on installation.

Package: abraflexi-adminzone-sledovanitv
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
