 abraflexi-adminzone (= ${binary:Version}),
 php-curl
Breaks: abraflexi-adminzone (<< 0.4.0)
Replaces: abraflexi-adminzone (<< 0.4.0)
Section: web
Priority: optional
Description: SledovaniTV extension for AbraFlexi AdminZone
 Pairing of SledovaniTV users with AbraFlexi addresses and their registration. Asks for the API credentials on installation.
